1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:08,984
Speaking, task one. Topic 2: Family. Ten questions. Listen to the question and answer out loud.

2
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,373
How many people are there in your family?

3
00:00:16,767 --> 00:00:20,531
There are four of us: my wife, two sons and me.

4
00:00:21,433 --> 00:00:22,772
Do you have any brothers or sisters?

5
00:00:28,167 --> 00:00:33,005
Yes, I have one brother. He is three years older and lives in Ukraine.

6
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,429
Where do your parents live?

7
00:00:40,833 --> 00:00:43,748
My parents live in Ukraine in a small town by a river.

8
00:00:44,633 --> 00:00:47,000
What does your husband or wife do?

9
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:55,365
My wife works in a hospital as a nurse.

10
00:00:56,267 --> 00:00:57,824
How old are your children?

11
00:01:03,233 --> 00:01:07,405
My son is nine and my daughter is five. My son is in the third year at school.

12
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:10,150
What do you like doing as a family?

13
00:01:15,567 --> 00:01:18,776
As a family we like going for walks and at the weekend we play games.

14
00:01:19,667 --> 00:01:21,432
How often do you call your parents?

15
00:01:26,833 --> 00:01:29,973
I call my parents almost every evening when they are at home.

16
00:01:30,867 --> 00:01:32,637
When did you last see your parents?

17
00:01:38,033 --> 00:01:41,916
I last saw my parents last summer when they came to visit.

18
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:45,167
How did you celebrate the last birthday in your family?

19
00:01:50,567 --> 00:01:54,411
Last month we had a party at home for our son with a cake and friends.

20
00:01:55,300 --> 00:01:57,052
Where will you go with your family next time?

21
00:02:02,467 --> 00:02:05,197
Next summer we will go to the sea in Croatia with the family.

22
00:02:06,100 --> 00:02:15,899
Great! Practise topic 2 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
